  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "A huge black bear larger than Calamity Luck Altar knocks the Immortal Gu House flying. Fairy Zi Wei names him Senior Zhang Fei Xiong, a transformation path great expert of Heavenly Court most skilled in bear-type transformations, with strength that can rival mountains and power that can move the earth. He laughs, pounces, and presses Calamity Luck Altar down. He is among the Gu Immortals who wake from Heavenly Court’s immortal graveyard in that battle.",
      "chapters": [
        1715
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_calamity_luck_altar",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house",
        "char_fairy_zi_wei",
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "loc_immortal_graveyard"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Longevity Heaven reinforcements leave the River of Time, Nu Er Bao Xiong’s exploding lightning forces the giant bear Zhang Fei Xiong transformed into back five to six steps, leaving deep facial injuries and blood across his face.",
      "chapters": [
        1717
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "lightning-wound",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_longevity_heaven",
        "loc_river_of_time",
        "char_nu_er_bao_xiong"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He growls, turns into a giant with a bear head and human body, and charges Red River Wheel until Jade Toad Castle crashes into him. After being knocked away he returns, tells Flesh Whip Immortal to heal, and takes her place. Under Divine Bean Palace’s myriad life spring lightning he reverts to his human body and flies in a sad state with other Heavenly Court Gu Immortals.",
      "chapters": [
        1925
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "bear-giant-at-emperor-city",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_red_river_wheel",
        "house_jade_toad_castle",
        "char_flesh_whip_immortal",
        "house_divine_bean_palace"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He enters Zhou Xiong Xin’s rumor cage with Zhu Que Er while others block Southern Border reinforcement. Inside that information path battlefield he and Zhu Que Er use transformation path attainment to become information path immemorial desolate beasts and help the fight that ends with Chi Qu You devoured.",
      "chapters": [
        1932
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "transformation-aid-against-chi-qu-you",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_zhou_xiong_xin",
        "char_zhu_que_er",
        "reg_southern_border",
        "char_chi_qu_you"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He roars, becomes a giant with a bear head and human body, and attacks Di Zang Sheng with no fear of death. He is crushed into meat paste and dies on the spot. Narration calls him a rank eight transformation path great expert who could only obstruct the Evil Dragon for a brief moment.",
      "chapters": [
        1942
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death-against-di-zang-sheng",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_di_zang_sheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Qin Ding Ling’s side notes that Heavenly Court once had transformation path great experts Zhang Fei Xiong and Flesh Whip Immortal, but that they are now dead, leaving Nine Spiritual Fairy as the only transformation path great expert left.",
      "chapters": [
        2027
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "named-among-the-dead",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qin_ding_ling",
        "char_nine_spiritual_fairy"
      ]
    }
  ],
